\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S2}{\ignorespaces Simulated evolution of LLY stock prices (a), put values (b), and call values (c) along 1{,}000 paths between April 28 and May 29, 2026. The fitted surfaces included observations from this scenario period; these are illustrative paths, not an out-of-sample forecast. Time is measured in calendar days from April 28. Black curves show pointwise medians, and shading contains the middle 90\% of values. Red and blue curves show group medians for the 1st--5th and 95th--99th terminal-stock percentiles. Option values are dollars per share and represent repurchase costs for a short seller. Entry premiums were \$23.30 per share for the put and \$20.76 for the call.}}{26}{figure.caption.26}\protected@file@percent }
